            <p>
                <strong>9. </strong>
                The chart lists events in &#x201c;Lost in the Dust.&#x201d; Drop <strong>one</strong> possible cause for each event in the chart. (Two causes will not be used.)
            </p>
            <qti-gap-match-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE_1" shuffle="false">
                <qti-prompt><strong>Possible Causes:</strong></qti-prompt>
                <qti-gap-text match-max="1" identifier="X91137-t01as01asi009asic004">A. Dust and grit covered the drying clothes outside.</qti-gap-text>
                <qti-gap-text match-max="1" identifier="X91137-t01as01asi009asic005">B. Mama hung sheets on the line to dry.</qti-gap-text>
                <qti-gap-text match-max="1" identifier="X91137-t01as01asi009asic006">C. The author ran into the wheat and got lost.</qti-gap-text>
                <qti-gap-text match-max="1" identifier="X91137-t01as01asi009asic007">D. After three years of drought, Daddy could not grow any wheat.</qti-gap-text>
                <qti-gap-text match-max="1" identifier="X91137-t01as01asi009asic008">E. Droughts and dust storms struck the area for years.</qti-gap-text>
